  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Trail Slabs
    AbilityDescription: Mass raises the grown trail slab maximum size
      (GrowTrailActionSO.massMaxSizeMultiplier, x1 -> x1.5 at level 10 floored at
      x0.25, so the 4-unit slab ceiling reaches 6). Note GrowTrailAction.asset also
      carries an ENABLED maxSize ElementalFloat authored 4 -> 8 on Mass that nothing
      evaluates - MaxSize reads its raw Value - so that second ramp has never run.
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: 
    UpgradeDescription: 
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: (open design slot)
