  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Ramp Spool
    AbilityDescription: 'Time raises how fast the ramp boost winds the Rhino up to its
      top speed - the same 220/s the executor already scales, from 110/s at rest to
      550/s at full (RampBoostActionSO.timeAccelerationMultiplier). It does not raise
      the ceiling, only how long the run-up to it takes, so a Rhino that keeps the
      stick straight arrives sooner rather than faster. That sentence was FALSE as
      shipped until the element-scaling unification: the fleet-wide boost read in
      VesselTransformer.CurrentBoostAmount applied this same element to the ceiling
      too, undeclared here and unmodelled by regatta_balance.py. The ceiling is now
      untouched by Time - BoostSpeedMultiplier is disabled on Rhino.prefab.'
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
